  "description": "A high-performance CSV conversion library for .NET. Convert CSV files or streams to DataTable/IEnumerable with support for forward/reverse reading, multiple encodings (UTF-8, UTF-16, etc.), custom delimiters, and generic type conversion. Supports international languages including English, Chinese, Japanese, Spanish, and more.",
